msgid "Description"
msgstr "Popis"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/planes_blur.rst:42
msgid ""
"This effect applies just to three :term:`Planes <plane>`: :term:`Luma`, :"
"term:`Chroma` and Alpha. You define the :guilabel:`Radius` and :guilabel:"
"`Power` to determine the strength of the effect."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt sa vzťahuje len na tri :term:`roviny<plane>`: :term:`Luma`, :"
"term:`Chroma` a Alfa. Definujete :guilabel:`Polomer` a :guilabel:`Sila` na "
"určenie intenzity efektu."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/planes_blur.rst:46
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametre"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/planes_blur.rst:53
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/planes_blur.rst:54
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Hodnota"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/planes_blur.rst:59
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/planes_blur.rst:64
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Celé číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/planes_blur.rst:60
msgid ""
"Set an expression for the box radius in pixels used for blurring the "
"corresponding input plane. Default value for :guilabel:`Luma Radius` is "
"**2**. If not specified, :guilabel:`Chroma Radius` and :guilabel:`Alpha "
"Radius` default to the corresponding value set for :guilabel:`Luma Radius`."
msgstr ""
"Nastavuje polomer rámu v pixeloch pre rozostrenie príslušnej vstupnej "
"roviny. Predvolená hodnota pre :guilabel:`Polomer Luma` je **2**. Ak nie je "
"zadaná, :guilabel:`Polomer Chroma` a :guilabel:`Polomer Alfa` predvolene "
"nadobúdajú hodnotu nastavenú pre :guilabel:`Polomer Luma`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/planes_blur.rst:65
msgid ""
"Specify how many times the boxblur filter is applied to the corresponding "
"plane. Default value for :guilabel:`Luma Power` is **2**. If not specified, :"
"guilabel:`Chroma Power` and :guilabel:`Alpha Power` default to the "
"corresponding value set for :guilabel:`Luma Power`. A value of 0 will "
"disable the effect."
msgstr ""
"Určuje, koľkokrát sa filter boxblur aplikuje na príslušnú rovinu. Predvolená "
"hodnota pre :guilabel:`Sila Luma` je **2**. Ak nie je zadaná, :guilabel:"
"`Sila Chroma` a :guilabel:`Sila Alfa` predvolene nadobúdajú hodnotu "
"nastavenú pre :guilabel:`Sila Luma`. Hodnota 0 vypne efekt."

